<%# The trail above a company or plant page (#708): Nuclear Directory › category. The page's own name is the heading right
    below, so it isn't repeated (#700); the structured data keeps the full trail. One line, never wrapping: the category shortens
    (full text in title) before anything wraps. Locals: trail (DirectoryHelper#page_trail). %>
<nav class="nd-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
  <ol>
    <% trail[0...-1].each do |label, path| %>
      <li><%= link_to label, path, class: "nd-link nd-link--muted", title: label %></li>
    <% end %>
  </ol>
</nav>
